WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.080 line:84%
In this lesson we learn the names of family members: mother, father, brother, and sister.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:11.360 line:84%
Dada ji, dadi ji, beta, and beti. Grandfather, grandmother, son, and daughter.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.880 line:84%
Yeh meri maata ji hain. This is my mother. Woh mere pita ji hain. That is my father.
